  "description": "Ever set a reminder only to forget you set it? Designed with ADHD in mind, Short-Term Reminder cuts through the noise so nothing slips past you.\n      \n      • Create & manage quick reminders in seconds — no friction, no fuss\n      • Bold, full-screen alerts that demand attention when it matters\n      • Quick-action alarm buttons for one-tap reminder creation\n      • Configurable settings to tailor notifications to your workflow\n      • Active reminder dashboard so you always know what's next\n      \n      Stay on track, stay centered — your brain deserves a backup plan.",
